  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.header": "使用汤锅",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_1": "想要使用汤锅烹饪，需要将汤锅置于有效热源之上",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_2": "首先，向汤锅内添加汤底",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_3": "接下来，添加烹饪所需的食材",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_4": "确保食谱无误后，盖上汤锅盖",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_5": "接下来只需等待片刻……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_6": "……然后揭开锅盖",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_7": "烹饪就完成啦！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.header": "使用炒锅",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_1": "想要使用炒锅烹饪，需要将炒锅置于有效热源之上",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_2": "首先，起锅烧油！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_3": "接下来，添加烹饪所需的食材",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_4": "确保食谱无误后，开始翻炒！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_5": "接下来只需等待片刻……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_6": "……料理就完成啦！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.header": "放置蒸笼",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_1": "想要使用蒸笼烹饪，需要将蒸笼置于有效热源之上",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_2": "对着蒸笼顶部放置蒸笼，可以向上堆叠……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_3": "……一直向上堆叠",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_4": "然而，一个热源只能为8个蒸笼提供热量……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_5": "……所以，请注意堆叠的数量",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.header": "使用蒸笼",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_1": "从蒸笼顶部放入待蒸的食材",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_2": "也可直接堆叠装有食材的蒸笼",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_3": "放置完毕后，给蒸笼封顶以开始烹饪",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_4": "接下来只需等待一段时间……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_5": "待到烹饪完成，便可揭下蒸笼顶盖……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_6": "……最后一层层取下蒸笼与成品",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.header": "使用搪瓷盆子",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.text_1": "打开搪瓷盆盖以存入油脂",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.text_2": "使用锅铲可以从搪瓷盆子中取出 1 份油脂……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.text_3": "……你就能用沾有油脂的锅铲来给炒锅添油了",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.header": "使用石磨",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_1": "手持待加工的物品右键磨盘可以将其放入石磨",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_2": "磨盘上方的掉落物也会被自动置入石磨中",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_3": "石磨会自动绑定周围的生物",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_4": "绑定了生物后，石磨开始工作……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_5": "……走过一圈后，材料转化为成品，从开口喷出",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.header": "使用旋风烤肉塔",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_1": "首先将食材放入旋风烤肉塔的上下两层",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_2": "每层最多能够放入 8 个相同的可烧炼食物",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_3": "通入红石信号以激活烤肉塔，开始烹饪",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_4": "接下来只需等待一段时间……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_5": "……烹饪就完成啦！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_6": "然而，直接从激活的旋风烤肉塔上空手取下食物会被烧伤",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_7": "正确的做法是使用菜刀取下食物……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_8": "……或是先关闭激活烤肉塔的红石信号再尝试取下食物",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.recipe_item.header": "使用菜谱",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.recipe_item.text_1": "手持空白的菜谱右键已有物品放入的炒锅或汤锅，会将当前已加入的材料和烹饪结果记录到菜谱中",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.recipe_item.text_2": "手持已记录食物配方的菜谱右键炒锅或汤锅，会将背包中携带有的记录在菜谱中的材料自动加入锅中",
